## 2025-08-10 02:33:26 Found Delay Source - Massive Polling Delay
# FOUND THE ISSUE: Grid event detection has huge delays:
#   - Button press to event detection: 735ms - 1200ms (735,749μs to 1,199,754μs)
#   - Once detected, processing is fast: 71-110μs total
# Problem: Grid polling is taking nearly 1 second to detect button events
# Root cause: OSC socket blocking with 500ms timeout in grid_osc.rs
# Fixed: Changed socket.set_read_timeout() to socket.set_nonblocking(true)

